Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix(api): validate shared-runtime handoffs early, deduplicate nested @tools, and forward turn callbacks

Fixes three Handoff/subagent runtime issues in openminion==0.1.24:
1. Fail fast at Agent.__init__ when a Handoff target with decorated @tools shares the
   parent's APIRuntime instead of silently failing mid-turn with an opaque EXEC_ERROR.
2. Skip already-registered tools in _register_tools_for_run() (checking registry.get())
   so nested same-thread agents sharing a @tool do not crash with ToolRuntimeError.
3. Propagate approval_callback, timeout_seconds, cancel_event, and on_delta into
   handoff.target.run()/run_stream() via ContextVar.
